      "comment": "YNOBE NOVA (3) finished fourth last start, beaten 9 metres at Terang over 2180m. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Has the talent to take this out. ALLGOOD VINNIE (2) went back last start and couldn't make up the leeway when seventh, beaten 175 metres, at Terang over 2180m a month ago. Kept up to the mark with a subsequent placing at the trials. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. This doesn't look as hard and is capable of taking this out if he can reproduce his win five starts back. EASTBRO KAZ (4) is better than her last-start eighth over 1660m at Hamilton. GOLD IN PARIS (5) is better than her last-start ninth over 2200m at Horsham.",
